WEBVTT

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:04.600
Nakasaki, I heard you just had a kid.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.270
Uh, where did you hear that?

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.030
Is it male or female?

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:09.210
It's a girl.

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:11.120
Maybe I should take her.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.610
P-Please don't...

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.650
Girls become independent 
earlier than boys.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.870
It won't be long before she 
stops listening to you.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:21.870
Th-That won't happen with Fuko!

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.120
I will raise her to be the 
biggest father lover in Japan!

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:27.070
Yeah, that's the spirit.

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:28.130
Th-This is...

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:30.590
I-I can't accept this much money!

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.530
It's not for you.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.790
I only spend money on fine women.

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:40.050
Let her drink the finest 
milk you can find.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:41.740
Th-Thank you very much!

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:29.000
<b>The Man's Household Situation 
is Hard, His Heart is Soft</b>

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.340
How many times have I told you?!

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:35.500
Wash my underwear 
separately from Father's!

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:37.510
Forgive me, ma'am.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:40.020
I'm going to wash them again myself!

00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:41.400
Geez!

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:46.500
Oh, sir.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.270
I'm terribly sorry.

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:49.790
I'll wash that again at once.

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:52.610
Hm? Are you the new maid?

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:53.650
What's your name?

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:58.160
<b>Ichihara</b>

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:55.410
Ichihara?

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:56.680
What's your first name?

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:58.160
Hayato? Etsuko?

00:02:58.340 --> 00:03:00.910
It's not Etsuko, it's Ezurako.

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:03.790
Your face looks familiar...

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:05.920
It's not Zura, it's Ezurako.

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:07.130
Forget it.

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:09.040
Be careful from now on.

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.430
Do my laundry separate from Kuriko's.

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:13.650
And make sure we don't 
eat at the same time.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:15.410
It's not Zura, it's Ezurako.

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:19.020
Yeah, just listen to 
my daughter. Got it,

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:20.350
Ezurako?

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:22.000
It's not Ezurako, it's Katsura.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:22.680
What?

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:26.280
Oh, I made a mistake. It's Ezurako.

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:28.910
Whatever. Just go.

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:31.200
Oof.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:35.220
The police commissioner, 
Katakuriko Matsudaira.

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:38.160
The man who is known as the Destroyer

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:40.630
to those who wish to 
disrupt the order of Edo.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:44.320
The greatest foe of the Joi patriots.

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:46.260
In an attempt to uncover a scandal,

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.790
I've been working undercover 
at his home for a week.

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:53.920
My focus has shifted away from my 
inability to learn anything useful

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.850
to this peculiar loneliness I see.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:59.800
Is this what it means to be a father?

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:02.810
If so, what is a father? What is a man?

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:08.690
Who does he fight for? Who 
is he trying to protect?

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:16.030
Um...

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:19.530
What are you doing, Ezurako-san?

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:21.780
I'm terribly sorry.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.250
After working as a maid for so long,

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:26.660
I've picked up this 
habit of eavesdropping.

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:29.370
You also picked up the door.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.520
Please let me know if 
I'm being a bother.

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:36.630
I also have a graffiti version 
and a mental AT Field version.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:38.080
Please get rid of it.

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:39.930
You're making too much noise.

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:41.280
Um...

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:46.430
Sorry about yelling at you earlier.

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:48.390
It's okay. I didn't mind.

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:49.980
I said to get rid of that.

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:51.440
Did you think you could fool me?

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:54.440
Um, to make up for earlier,

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:57.180
some of my friends booked

00:04:57.180 --> 00:05:00.820
Greater Edo Hills tomorrow 
for my birthday party.

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:04.330
Would you like to come?

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:06.360
Thank you very much.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:09.060
Oh, will your father also be coming?

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:11.040
I would never invite him!

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.850
Besides, he wouldn't come if I did.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.580
His birthday is very soon.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.210
I'm sure he'll celebrate it

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:23.600
at the usual place with all those women.

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:25.210
It's always the same.

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:30.850
He uses his work as an excuse 
to avoid facing his family.

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:36.860
I refuse to call that coward my father.

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:39.950
I wonder why...

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:43.620
I am starting to feel concern 
for my greatest foe.

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:50.370
Is it because Matsudaira's daughter 
was a nicer girl than I expected?

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:53.590
Or because I didn't want 
to think that I've been

00:05:53.590 --> 00:05:57.130
crossing swords with a man who 
can't control his own family.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.010
Sir?

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:01.980
Miss Kuriko's birthday 
party is tomorrow.

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:03.760
You shouldn't be sleeping out here.

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:05.760
Man, I'm gonna hurl...

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:08.890
Miss Kuriko wanted you to come.

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:13.350
You're going to Kuriko's 
birthday party, right?

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:16.520
Give that to her.

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:20.530
It'll make her happier that way.

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:23.820
Are you trying to teach her how men

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:27.900
are foolish, weak, and underhanded?

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:30.790
Is that your duty as a father?

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:33.190
Ezurako-san, that's enough!

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:35.830
And why are you walking 
around with that board?!

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:37.530
It's fine, Nakasaki.

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:42.670
I like a maid who's willing 
to speak her mind.

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:46.730
But I'm not much of a father.

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:50.050
Young people think 
that men grow wiser as

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:52.640
they get older, but it's not true.

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:55.730
I'm just as stupid as I always was.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:07:01.250
Still the same old shy kid who 
can't bring myself to look

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:05.700
my precious daughter in the face, 
or even talk to her.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:08.330
I'll leave this with you.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:11.700
I was becoming more confused.

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:15.710
The man spoke openly 
of his own foolishness.

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:18.920
Was he a big shot, or just an idiot?

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:21.010
F-Forgive me, dear!

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:21.010
Crafty or innocent?

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:27.220
And I was most confused 
by my own behavior.

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:30.160
Um, excuse me.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:32.430
You're supposed to be dressed 
formally for this affair.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:35.810
And that is what I did.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:38.940
Um, only the left side 
is dressed formally.

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:40.940
And that's just a drawing.

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.870
Ah, you have a problem 
with me wearing a tuxedo?

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:46.450
Don't worry. I also brought a dress.

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:47.440
Um...

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:50.410
We're not supposed to let 
anyone suspicious in.

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:52.580
What about me would be 
considered suspicious?!

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:53.410
Everything.

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:56.170
How dare you insult me?!

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:58.890
Are celebrities so special?!

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:02.760
Your birthday party's probably 
nothing more than an **gy!

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:04.670
How can you say such a hateful thing?!

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:08.100
A sinful gathering where you wear masks

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:12.440
and put things on your sticks,
and shove them into...

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:14.680
That's just a cheese fondue!

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:17.600
Don't say that so loudly here.

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:18.810
Have you no shame?!

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:21.330
You're the one who's 
having naughty thoughts

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:22.470
about a cheese fondue!

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:24.250
Oh, sorry.

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:27.850
She's with me.

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:28.950
Ah, Nakasaki-san.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:31.960
I'm here in place of the commissioner.

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:32.950
I see...

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:34.930
So he isn't coming.

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:37.140
Ah! Ezurako-san! Nakasaki-san!

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.460
You came to the party!

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.490
I'm so happy!

00:08:41.490 --> 00:08:43.210
Now come inside!

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:53.070
What is this?!

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:53.850
What's happening?!

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:55.640
Did the system malfunction?!

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:57.140
No...

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:04.150
It's a terrorist attack.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.610
<b>Incoming Call from Kuriko</b>

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:08.020
Hello?

00:09:08.390 --> 00:09:10.660
Is this Katakuriko Matsudaira?

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:13.620
Your daughter's life is in our hands.

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:18.410
The Blues Crew has taken 
control of Greater Edo Hills.

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:20.480
If you value your daughter's life,

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:22.420
you'll listen to our demands.

00:09:24.470 --> 00:09:26.150
Hey, can you hear me?

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:27.820
Is somebody in there?

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:31.730
That's weird. It sure stinks.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:40.810
Can't you let a man 
take a dump in peace?

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:45.350
What?

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:46.090
That's...

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:51.610
Th-The commissioner!

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:53.870
So he did come.

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:58.090
What are you doing up there?!

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:01.610
I appreciate it, Ezurako.

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:05.090
Thanks to you, I won't be late.

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:08.770
Wh-Where are you going, Commissioner?!

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:11.160
That was no longer the frail back

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:13.010
of an old man washing underwear.

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:20.500
That was the stalwart back 
of the Destroyer we feared.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.830
The hostages include the children of

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:26.990
various Bakufu officials 
along with Kuriko-chan.

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:30.800
The Blues Crew must have learned about

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:33.160
this party and planned the attack.

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:37.440
I remember that some of 
their members were arrested

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:39.730
for plotting to assassinate the boss.

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:41.730
They're demanding that 
those members be released.

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:43.920
And they also want the boss's head.

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:46.200
If we don't agree to their demands,

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.670
they'll start killing a 
hostage every thirty minutes.

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:52.980
I'll go negotiate and 
try to buy us some time.

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:56.080
You guys need to find a way inside.

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:56.760
Yes, sir!

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:58.260
And Yamazaki,

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:00.160
did you get a hold of the boss?

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.640
His phone's been busy the whole time.

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:05.520
Damn that old fart.

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:07.770
What's he doing?

00:11:08.030 --> 00:11:10.280
Hello? Ane-chan?

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:11.650
Sorry.

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:14.080
I won't be able to join you tonight.

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:15.980
Right now? I'm in a duct.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:19.680
No, I didn't change careers.

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:23.600
I'm devoted to you, Ane-chan.

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:26.940
Oh, sorry. I got another call.

00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:29.740
My men are so annoying.

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:31.260
Buh-bye.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:32.920
Ah, he finally answered the phone!

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:33.790
Are you okay, Commissioner?!

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:36.260
How many times did you 
call me, you fool?!

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:40.760
Don't call my phone when 
I'm in terrorist territory.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.600
You're terrorizing my 
conversation with Ane-chan!

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:45.120
You have no right to talk when you're

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:46.770
calling female escorts while 
sneaking up on terrorists!

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:50.360
I was just settling matters 
so the women left behind

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:52.500
in this cruel world don't grieve.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:55.870
When a man dies, everyone 
should be wearing pure white.

00:11:55.870 --> 00:11:58.350
I have fifty more girls 
to call, so hold on.

00:11:58.350 --> 00:12:00.130
It's too late to clean up your act!

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:01.080
Your soul is completely black!

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:04.730
Anyway, Hijikata-san and the other men 
will be entering the building soon.

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:06.420
Don't do anything hasty.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.360
No, we can't wait for them.

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:10.090
Ezurako-san?

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:12.880
They've taken over the security system.

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:14.860
It won't be easy to 
approach the building.

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:17.900
Huh? Then we shouldn't be here.

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:22.120
I put something in this 
car to jam their radar.

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:27.070
And I did the same thing 
to Matsudaira's present.

00:12:28.770 --> 00:12:29.640
You're...

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:33.470
I happen to be acquainted 
with Edo's top tinkerer.

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:36.740
In three hours, they'll 
begin executing hostages.

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:43.740
In other words, I need to end 
their lives before they end mine.

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:45.180
Exactly.

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:46.140
Ezurako-san!

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:48.460
But you won't be able to do it

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:50.500
by recklessly wandering around alone.

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:52.120
I'll assist you.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:57.820
I knew something was fishy.

00:12:57.820 --> 00:13:00.010
You're no ordinary maid.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.010
I'm just an ordinary maid

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:03.780
who enjoys eavesdropping.

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:07.520
How are negotiations going?

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:11.020
It'll take a day to secure 
the release of our brethren.

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:13.460
They're obviously trying to buy time.

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:14.420
Tell them this.

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:16.940
We aren't giving them any more time.

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:17.780
Yes, sir.

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:20.220
And one more thing.

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:23.950
Tell them that Matsudaira's 
life is already ours,

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:25.860
though, technically, we still have to go

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:27.500
through the formality 
of taking it from him.

00:13:27.980 --> 00:13:31.250
I didn't expect him to sneak in 
by himself to save his daughter.

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:35.200
H-He won't come!

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:38.550
He would never try to save me...

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:41.680
Don't make a fuss. You'll 
be seeing him real soon.

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:44.480
We'll have him tied 
up with a red ribbon.

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:49.100
Listen up. They're holed up in the

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:51.190
main control room on the top floor.

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:53.630
You're on the 9th floor.

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:56.230
Every floor from the 10th 
up is packed with guards.

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:59.770
I see. So this marker 
on the 9th floor is me.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:00.740
Wait a moment!

00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:02.880
Why did you use this symbol for me?!

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:03.950
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:06.270
That's the tip of an ice cream cone.

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:09.500
And the three markers on 
the 10th floor are enemies.

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:12.990
Why do they get cones when I don't?

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:14.880
Otherwise, you wouldn't be 
able to tell friend from foe.

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.510
Give me a cone!

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:19.470
I love to suck the last bit of ice 
cream out of the end of a cone.

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:22.910
Fine, I'll put corn in your poop.

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:24.240
I said cone, not corn!

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:26.760
And you said poop. You just 
admitted that it's poop.

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:28.410
Uh, does it really matter?!

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:30.420
In any case, you need to avoid those

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:33.800
ice cream cones as you make 
your way to the 50th floor.

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:34.770
Look carefully.

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:39.230
The tip of the ice cream is 
tipping left and right, yes?

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:41.810
The tip indicates the 
direction they're facing.

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:45.110
When the three tips are tipping 
in the same direction,

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:47.670
you should tip past them.

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:49.060
That's too complicated!

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:53.270
Why do you have to use 
the word tip so much?!

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:54.670
Ah, hold on...

00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:57.040
There's an ice cream cone coming down!

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.800
What?! It's tipping like crazy!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.050
Is it in a hurry?

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:03.900
10th floor... He didn't get off!

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:06.260
Has he noticed that the 
commissioner's on the 9th floor?

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:07.300
Hide quick!

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:09.310
Oh, no!

00:15:09.310 --> 00:15:10.060
Huh?!

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:11.050
W-Wait!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.060
The ice cream cone split in two!

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:15.100
What's going on up there?

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:17.740
A guy ran off somewhere.

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:20.090
But the ice cream's 
still in the elevator!

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:23.590
He just pooped his pants!

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:26.200
Apparently, both people and poop

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:28.270
are registered under 
the ice cream marker.

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:30.930
Why is poop even registered 
on your scanner?!

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:33.870
And why am I not registered as a human?!

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:37.350
He took the elevator 
down to find a bathroom,

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:40.380
but he couldn't hold it 
in and had to sparking!

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:41.380
Look.

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:44.680
The cone is becoming wet.

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:46.560
Is he wiping his ass?

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:48.630
No, he's probably crying.

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:52.210
Wait, I thought that there were 
only enemies above you, but...

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:54.730
It's mostly poop up there!

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:58.270
I can no longer tell which 
are human and which are poop.

00:15:58.710 --> 00:16:02.600
When I blew up that bathroom,
I probably burst the water main.

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:05.990
They can no longer take 
care of their business.

00:16:05.990 --> 00:16:07.780
Still, this is too many!

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:10.400
However, we can use this 
situation to our advantage.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:11.160
Look!

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:13.500
Th-This is...

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:17.210
They're all running down in 
search of clean restrooms!

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:19.250
They really need to take a shit!

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:21.880
They're using the stairs.

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:24.120
This is your chance to 
take the elevator up!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.260
Hold on!

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:29.860
The wet cone is racing to the 
elevator at a crazy speed!

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:31.460
Did he notice the commissioner?

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:34.910
No, now that he's calmed down,

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:37.310
he's returning for his underwear 
so he can destroy the evidence.

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:39.270
Hurry, Matsudaira!

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:41.270
He made it in time.

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:43.500
Th-That's...!

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:45.740
He's hanging on to the 
bottom of the elevator!

00:16:46.010 --> 00:16:48.440
He is dedicated to his underwear!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:50.470
He really doesn't want 
anyone to find out!

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:53.320
Commissioner! The cone is below you!

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:54.660
And which one is the commissioner?!

00:16:55.940 --> 00:17:00.160
Ah! The cone is using the pointy 
edge to try to break through!

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.380
Uh, what pointy edge?

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:04.330
That's just a marker!

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:05.130
What?!

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:06.940
He penetrated the poop!

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:08.630
Wait, is that the commissioner?!

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:09.550
Or is it the poop?!

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:10.800
Which is it?!

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:13.810
He's trying to drag Matsudaira off!

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:18.150
Oh! Saved at the last second!

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:19.190
How?!

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:21.510
How can poop save him?!

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:24.900
Is that actually Matsudaira?

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:28.220
Ah! The cone con finally 
cornered himself and fell!

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:31.530
Why was he trying so hard to protect 
a pair of dirty underwear?!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:32.280
This is bad.

00:17:32.640 --> 00:17:34.870
The Ice Cream Gang has noticed 
that something is wrong!

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:37.460
When he makes it to the 
top, he'll be gunned down!

00:17:38.460 --> 00:17:41.940
They split up! What the hell?!

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:45.210
How the hell are two turds 
moving around independently?!

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.190
It's going to draw their attention

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:49.430
so Matsudaira can make it to the top!

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:51.970
It's just a pair of 
underwear with poop on it!

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:54.120
How did it turn into the 
commissioner's partner?!

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:55.030
Look!

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:56.470
The Ice Cream Gang is ignoring the

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:57.900
underwear and gathering 
on the 50th floor!

00:17:57.900 --> 00:17:58.810
No shit, Sherlock!

00:17:58.810 --> 00:18:00.540
He's completely trapped!

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:11.490
What?!

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:16.450
The ice cream cones are disappearing.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.460
This poop was actually the diversion...?

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:32.890
Happy birthday to you.

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:41.150
He really took out all of 
the terrorists by himself...

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:44.950
No, there's one cone left.

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:50.740
Sorry about that.

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:55.410
Your precious underwear 
and squad are all gone.

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:58.540
No, I should thank you.

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:00.540
No one will know now.

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:07.540
You're placing your duty as a 
cop over your duty as a father?!

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:10.610
Well, you can't call yourself a father

00:19:10.610 --> 00:19:13.920
if you don't mind your daughter 
being used as a shield.

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:17.450
But you can't even call 
yourself a man if you let

00:19:17.450 --> 00:19:20.570
someone who hurt your daughter 
walk away unscathed.

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:23.060
A father's duty isn't much to speak of.

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:27.060
Kids are raised fine by their mothers.

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:32.890
As long as I'm bringing in 
money, I have no other use.

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:38.000
All that's left is to praise her 
when she does something good,

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:41.300
and scold her when she 
does something bad.

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:42.830
That's about it.

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:48.260
This fist represents my duty 
as a police commissioner

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:52.460
and a lousy Edo dad.

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:56.400
That's...!

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:56.970
My...

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:59.220
My underwear is still around!

00:20:01.030 --> 00:20:04.290
The decoy was my own underwear.

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:06.230
I have one thing to say 
to you as a father.

00:20:10.970 --> 00:20:13.360
Wash your own

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:19.110
shitty underwear!

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:27.080
What a waste.

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:30.540
This was your chance to 
score some points with her.

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:32.760
She won't remember a thing.

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:36.010
I'm fine with playing 
the role of a lousy dad

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:38.130
since it's easy.

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:40.010
Open the box.

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:42.540
It's not your present.

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:45.640
I found it when I was cleaning 
your daughter's room.

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:52.690
She was probably going to give 
it to you if you showed up.

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.690
<b>Happy Birthday Father</b>

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:55.100
Don't worry.

00:20:55.490 --> 00:20:57.950
I left your present in its place.

00:20:58.160 --> 00:21:00.540
How is that supposed 
to make me feel better?

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:04.320
A maid who goes into my daughter's 
room without permission

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:06.460
gets fired on the spot.

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:07.490
Nakasaki!

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:07.960
Yes, sir!

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:11.210
Dump this rotten maid in a ditch.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:12.690
Understood.

00:21:12.990 --> 00:21:15.530
I'll dump the maid in a ditch 
where the police won't notice.

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:17.560
Stop yapping and leave!

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:17.970
Yes, sir!

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:22.220
The next time we meet, you'll 
meet more than my fist, Katsura.

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:25.970
I wouldn't have it any other way.

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:30.480
The police commissioner, 
Katakuriko Matsudaira.

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:34.980
<b>Matsudaira</b>

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:34.980
The greatest foe of the Joi patriots.

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:38.480
Stop that, sir!

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.790
It doesn't matter if he doesn't 
feel welcome in his own home.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:40.790
I can do the laundry!

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:41.830
The world is his home.

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:43.970
Forget it. I'll do this.

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:45.950
And so he goes off to work again.

00:21:43.970 --> 00:21:45.950
Oh, Miss Kuriko.

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:49.000
That's a lovely hairpin.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:52.330
However, I have seen on display

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:57.640
the bond between father and daughter 
as they stand back to back.

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:02.510
As well as the dignity of 
a so-called lousy father.

00:22:02.910 --> 00:22:04.650
Katakuriko Matsudaira.

00:22:05.350 --> 00:22:08.440
You make a fitting opponent.

00:23:40.110 --> 00:23:44.990
<b>Next Episode: Blue and Red Ecstasy</b>

00:23:40.850 --> 00:23:42.000
Next time:

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:44.010
Blue and Red Ecstasy.
